  "details": "In previous versions of VRChat, we could control a UI with a cursor that using a mouse when it wasn't connected to any controllers.\n\nBut after build 1490, the cursor doesn't show up and we can't control anything.\n\nIf it's not connected to any controllers, we can't even click the Go button to go to the home world.\n\nSteps to reproduce\n\n1. Launch SteamVR\n\n2. Launch VRChat without connecting to any controllers\n\n3. Can't control anything.",
